BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-21T01:30:00&endDate=2026-11-23T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPICCADILLY LINE: From 0130 Saturday 21 and all day Sunday 22 November\, including Friday and Saturday Night Tube\, no service between Hammersmith and Heathrow (all terminals) / Uxbridge. There will also be no METROPOLITAN LINE services between Harrow-on-the-Hill and Uxbridge. Use ELIZABETH LINE services between Central London and Heathrow.
